{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000653","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000653"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000653","label":"召平","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"召平","mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0003"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p004","quote":"召平"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0003"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p004"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-007-xiangyu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"召平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000653","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p004","text":"廣陵人召平於是為陳王徇廣陵，未能下。聞陳王敗走，秦兵又且至，乃渡江矯陳王命，拜梁為楚王上柱國。曰：「江東已定，急引兵西擊秦。」項梁乃以八千人渡江而西。聞陳嬰已下東陽，使使欲與連和俱西。陳嬰者，故東陽令史，居縣中，素信謹，稱為長者。東陽少年殺其令，相聚數千人，欲置長，無適用，乃請陳嬰。嬰謝不能，遂彊立嬰為長，縣中從者得二萬人。少年欲立嬰便為王，異軍蒼頭特起。陳嬰母謂嬰曰：「自我為汝家婦，未嘗聞汝先古之有貴者。今暴得大名，不祥。不如有所屬，事成猶得封侯，事敗易以亡，非世所指名也。」嬰乃不敢為王。謂其軍吏曰：「項氏世世將家，有名於楚。今欲舉大事，將非其人，不可。我倚名族，亡秦必矣。」於是眾從其言，以兵屬項梁。項梁渡淮，黥布、蒲將軍亦以兵屬焉。凡六七萬人，軍下邳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"召平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000653","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000598","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000598","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000598","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"陳嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000655","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"陳嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000655","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0115","start":115,"end":119,"surface":"東陽少年","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"陳嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000655","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0142","start":142,"end":143,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000655","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0150","start":150,"end":151,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000655","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0167","start":167,"end":168,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000655","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m004-0179","start":179,"end":182,"surface":"陳嬰母","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000654","status":"contextual_provis